  "notes": "Passive transformer DI box. Input is 6.35 mm TS (instrument, or amp speaker output with the 30 dB INST/AMP pad); output is balanced XLR. The THRU/OUT jack sends the unbalanced signal to an on-stage amp; its connector is described only as a jack (listed as 6.35 mm). XLR genders are not stated in the guide; the usual convention (inputs female, outputs male) is used. Controls from the technical specifications: INST/AMP switch (30 dB pad), FILTER switch (low pass at 7.5 kHz) and GROUND LIFT. These switches change level, sound or grounding, not where the signal goes.",
